1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:48,000
His Majesty has arrived!

4
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,520
Quick! Take everything away! Hurry!

5
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,960
- Your Majesty.
- No, no.

6
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,480
There's no need for formalities. Here.

7
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,960
Are you feeling any better?

8
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,800
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

9
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,800
My illness comes from a broken heart.

10
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:20,160
I'm afraid I'll never recover.

11
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:23,640
I've served Your Majesty
for over twenty years,

12
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,840
always with respect and devotion.

13
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:29,480
And now,
a young girl dares to talk back to me.

14
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,440
Worse, Lady Li slapped me.

15
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,160
In front of everyone,

16
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,840
I was utterly humiliated.

17
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,640
What's the point of living anymore?

18
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,560
Didn't I send her to apologize to you?

19
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,280
You're the one who turned her away.

20
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,360
Who wants her fake sympathy?

21
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,800
Behind my back,

22
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,840
she arranged Liu Shuo's marriage
to the Xie family.

23
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:56,040
Then she rushed
to bring Hongxian into her household!

24
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:59,800
Why does she get
every good thing in the world?

25
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,160
Your Majesty,
how can she be so overbearing?

26
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,680
Your Majesty!

27
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,560
Ask that precious son of yours!

28
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,080
Now that he's Crown Prince,

29
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,400
he's grown ever more lecherous.

30
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:14,120
The beauties in his residence
outnumber the palace's attendants.

31
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:18,080
He even abducted women,
causing public outrage!

32
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,960
I had already pardoned him.

33
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:22,680
Yet he persuaded you
to stir up more trouble!

34
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,240
I was the one who arranged
Liu Shuo's marriage.

35
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,080
And you dare question my judgment?

36
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:32,160
It seems I shouldn't have come here today.

37
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,000
Your Majesty! Your Majesty, please!

38
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,720
I know I was wrong!

39
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,440
I… I was foolish!

40
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,760
From now on,
I'll make sure to advise the Crown Prince

41
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,480
to watch his words and actions.

42
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,000
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

43
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,200
Get up.

44
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,960
You're still ill.

45
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:57,760
Don't let that ungrateful son
upset you and make you worse.

46
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,880
Your Majesty,

47
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,800
the Crown Prince is kind and devoted.

48
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:05,400
He'd even risk his life
to save you in a moment of danger.

49
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,800
No one can match his loyalty to you
as both ruler and father.

50
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,120
He's simply too young

51
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,520
and easily misled by petty schemers.

52
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:17,399
If Your Majesty appoints
more honest advisers to guide him,

53
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,240
I'm sure he'll change his ways.

54
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,399
I know.

55
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:25,000
I still have state affairs to attend to.
I'll return to Xuanshi Palace.

56
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:30,080
Your Majesty, please stay for dinner.

57
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:33,800
I've asked the kitchen
to prepare ginseng chicken soup

58
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,240
especially for you.

59
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,800
Your Majesty rarely visits Furong Hall.

60
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,720
And now,

61
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,720
you can't even bear

62
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,160
to share a meal with me?

63
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:50,800
I…

64
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:53,760
Once I've finished my work,
I'll come back and dine with you.

65
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,520
I won't blame you
for the Crown Prince's mistakes.

66
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

67
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,360
You there.

68
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,880
Bring me the herbs
the Crown Princess sent.

69
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,360
Yes, My Lady.

70
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,400
Go greet your elder sister.

71
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,920
Of course.

72
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,640
Why so quiet, sister-in-law?

73
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,040
What should you call me?

74
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,840
I was disrespectful to you before.

75
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:54,920
Please forgive me, Rao.

76
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,640
The one you resented was never me.

77
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,720
No old grudge at all,

78
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:03,880
it's only right that we make peace.

79
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:07,040
Rao, don't tease her.
She's a proper young lady.

80
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,440
She is, but you're not.

81
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,440
Otherwise, you wouldn't have
been sneaking around behind our backs.

82
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,640
Everyone, take a seat.

83
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,280
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

84
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,320
The infected from Anzhou
have entered the capital.

85
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,760
I'm sure the palace has heard by now.

86
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:28,200
I've been busy
with matters at my estate lately.

87
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,680
I won't be able to visit the palace often.

88
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:32,200
If Your Ladyship needs anything,
have Yinggu bring me a message.

89
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,680
Mother won't change Rao's mind.
There's no point wasting your breath.

90
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,160
Stubborn to the bone, as always.

91
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,800
Rao, please be careful.

92
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,160
I will.

93
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,720
Your Ladyship, His Majesty has sent word.

94
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,120
He won't be joining you for dinner today.
Please dine without him.

95
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,600
Whose palace has he gone to?

96
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,680
Furong Hall.

97
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,440
Lady Zheng?

98
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:03,240
Well, that's a first.

99
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:13,320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

100
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:17,320
Something isn't right at Furong Hall.
For His Majesty's safety,

101
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,520
Prince Fu and the others
should be informed.

102
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,880
Don't worry, Rao. I'll handle it.

103
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,080
Rao.

104
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:28,720
Please be careful.

105
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,680
I will.

106
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,680
You know,

107
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:42,800
Rao spent years living among commoners.

108
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,000
Before she even knew I existed,

109
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,800
Mother would constantly remind me…

110
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,920
<i>Remember what I'm telling you.</i>

111
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,240
<i>In the palace,</i>

112
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,920
<i>no matter how many siblings you have,</i>

113
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,160
they've all got their own schemes.

114
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,120
None of them are really on your side.

115
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,400
You have only one true sister,

116
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,720
born of the same mother.

117
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,000
Then where is my real sister?

118
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,320
With the Wei family.

119
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,080
Shuo, remember this.

120
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,840
When you're older, respect her.

121
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,040
Treat her well.

122
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,040
And on my behalf,
make up for what she's suffered.

123
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,520
Give her all the love you can.

124
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,159
YOUNG LIU SHUO

125
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,600
Mother wouldn't let me see her before.

126
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,880
She feared I'd bring trouble upon her.

127
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,600
Now we've finally been reunited.

128
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,720
But no matter how sincerely
I open my heart to her,

129
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:54,120
I still can't move her even a little.

130
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,520
Sometimes I really envy Lord Lu.

131
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,120
Somehow, he managed to melt her icy heart.

132
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,680
Someday, she'll understand how you feel.

133
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,600
I wish I knew how he did it.

134
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,120
I'm so jealous.

135
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,240
It just doesn't seem fair.

136
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:20,840
My sister and I should be closer
than anyone else in the world.

137
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,200
Shouldn't we?

138
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,840
Here.

139
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:37,320
- Take it straight over there.
- All right.

140
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,000
Hurry! Hurry!

141
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,160
Do you have enough ginger?

142
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,880
Coming.

143
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,080
- Careful, it's hot.
- This one is ready.

144
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,480
Here. I'll take it.

145
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,200
Mother?

146
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:58,080
- We need someone over here, too.
- Coming!

147
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,000
You can't be here.

148
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,440
If you are here, why can't I?

149
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,560
If I stay away, no one else will come.

150
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,720
But if I am here,
no one will dare to stay away.

151
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,360
You're just like my Zhuo.

152
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,360
He always leads his men into battle.

153
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,040
You two really are a perfect match.

154
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,800
Besides, I'm hardly of noble birth.

155
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:18,360
My own father was an army physician.
A little plague doesn't scare me.

156
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,440
Mother, treating plague patients
is no joke.

157
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,600
Neither am I.

158
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,720
If we hadn't stopped her,

159
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:26,280
the Dowager Lady would've come along, too.

160
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,360
We'll do exactly as I said.

161
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,600
Changning, Changhui, come help!

162
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:36,160
- Coming!
- No! I don't want to go over there!

163
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:40,960
The plague is spreading. No one is safe.

164
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:43,560
Hearing of Her Ladyship's
charity in medicine,

165
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:46,000
the noblewomen all followed suit.

166
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,840
Even your mother is out there,

167
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,320
doing everything to gather herbs.

168
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,880
Old Madam said no one
in our family runs from danger.

169
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,480
The ladies won't fall behind.

170
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:57,240
If you leave now,
you'll never set foot in the house again,

171
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,560
and call yourself one of us.

172
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,680
I…

173
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,880
- All right, all right.
- Now hurry up.

174
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:12,000
Mint leaves, burdock seeds, and scallions.

175
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,960
What remedy are you using?

176
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,320
The patients have chills
and dampness in their systems.

177
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,320
Many suffer from headaches
and pressure in the forehead,

178
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,680
fever, chills, coughing,
and shortness of breath.

179
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,120
I gathered every physician
in the city for a consultation.

180
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,520
We've agreed to treat them
with Wind-Dispelling Decoction.

181
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,880
My father once told me…
This works well in the early stages.

182
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,360
But once fever and yellow phlegm appear,

183
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,760
switch to Ganlu Disinfection Pills.

184
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:35,560
Their medicine is too cooling. Change it.

185
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,920
See?

186
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:43,600
The nausea is easy to treat, too.
Just add half a spoonful of ginger juice.

187
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:44,960
That should do the trick.

188
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,880
Do it.

189
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:49,600
Now do you believe me?

190
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,280
Thank you for your help, Mother.

191
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:54,320
Come on! Let's add more firewood

192
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:56,760
- and brew the medicine again!
- I'll take this over.

193
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,960
Coming!

194
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,280
Thank you!

195
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,480
Isn't she afraid?

196
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,800
She fears neither death nor filth.

197
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,240
No wonder the people worship her.

198
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,000
Even I have nothing but respect for her.

199
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,600
The young ladies keep asking me about her.

200
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,200
They all want to meet Noble Lady Wu'an.

201
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:22,600
You don't know how lucky you are.

202
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,520
Keep finding fault, and you'll regret it.

203
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,040
Here.

204
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,480
Here.

205
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:51,600
ZHAO

206
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,320
Another one collapsed?

207
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,920
All right! Resume your drills!

208
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,800
That's the seventh in three days.

209
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,040
Lu Zhuo, we can't go on like this.

210
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,600
They're not just trying
to disrupt the capital.

211
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,640
They want chaos in the army, too.

212
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,400
What are they after?

213
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,960
Now isn't the time for that.
Inspect the barracks first.

214
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:25,520
Move the sick to a ward for treatment.

215
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:33,080
XUANSHI PALACE

216
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:35,440
Your Majesty, a plague
has broken out in the army.

217
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,440
Twelve soldiers have fallen ill.

218
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:39,520
I ordered the physicians
to inspect the barracks.

219
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,600
We isolated the sick overnight
in separate wards.

220
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:44,480
Fortunately, we caught it early.
The disease hasn't spread.

221
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:48,080
Nothing must happen to the army.

222
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,440
I obey, Your Majesty.

223
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:54,840
Father, as Emperor,
the realm rests on your shoulders.

224
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,760
For the sake of your people,

225
00:13:56,840 --> 00:14:00,000
I humbly beg you
to withdraw to the Hot Springs Palace

226
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,480
until this crisis has passed.

227
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,640
Absolutely not!

228
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,400
Father, I risk my life to plead with you.

229
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,160
The Emperor is the father of his people.

230
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,280
They now trapped in their homes.

231
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:12,680
Father, you are the one taking command.

232
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,560
If the Crown Prince
fears the plague so much,

233
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:16,480
he's welcome to flee on his own!

234
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:19,960
I wish to stay and defend
the capital with you, Father!

235
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,560
What a devoted son you are.

236
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:24,480
You only care about your own reputation,
yet nothing about Father!

237
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:28,080
Father, I believe
we must reassure the people.

238
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,280
Your health comes first.
Best to withdraw to the traveling palace.

239
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:34,400
<i>Will it be the Crown Prince or Prince Fu?</i>

240
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,600
Your Majesty!

241
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:40,240
Your Majesty, Grand Minister Zhao
caught the plague.

242
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,240
He's passed away.

243
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,200
You heard that?

244
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,040
Emperors always took shelter from plagues.

245
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:48,360
Personal safety is a minor concern.
The foundation of the realm is at stake!

246
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,800
You're just showing off to win praise.

247
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:52,280
You're neither a dutiful son
nor a loyal subject!

248
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,400
- Grand Minister Zhao was nearly eighty!
- Your Majesty.

249
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:57,240
Father is still in his prime!
How can you compare the two?

250
00:14:58,520 --> 00:14:59,560
My elixir.

251
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,320
Bring me my elixir.

252
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,520
- Your Majesty!
- Father!

253
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,600
- Your Majesty!
- Father!

254
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:25,600
- Summon a physician!
- Father!

255
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:27,040
- Father!
- Father!

256
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:31,800
Your Majesty!

257
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,240
Father!

258
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:38,000
Father!

259
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:45,560
His Majesty collapsed from a fit of rage.

260
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,200
He will take the consorts

261
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,600
to the Hot Spring Palace
to avoid the plague.

262
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:51,720
Qi Zhongkai and I will escort him.

263
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,200
We leave tomorrow.

264
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:57,040
The Crown Prince or the Prince of Fu,
who goes and who stays?

265
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,760
The Crown Prince stays.
Prince Fu accompanies.

266
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,360
The Empress Dowager
resents the Han family case.

267
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,880
A lasting rift between them.

268
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,840
She harshly rebuked

269
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:08,160
the palace envoy sent to ask her to leave.

270
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:09,760
She insists on staying at Weiyang Palace.

271
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:19,680
His Majesty's life
is too precious to put at risk.

272
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:22,680
At a time like this,
it's best he seeks refuge elsewhere.

273
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,200
What? Reluctant to part with me, Lord Lu?

274
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,560
Even if I dragged you along,

275
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:49,960
you'd still refuse.

276
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,120
- Am I right?
- I'm not going.

277
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,240
I have too much to do here.

278
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,400
I'll wait for your return.

279
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,079
Watch out for hidden attacks.

280
00:17:09,119 --> 00:17:10,599
We're about to part ways.

281
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,119
No proper goodbyes, my dear?

282
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,319
Why must you keep nagging me?

283
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:29,000
Lord Lu, the Duke summons you urgently.

284
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,400
You heard it.

285
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,280
Grandfather wants a word.

286
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:35,720
Shouldn't you go?

287
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:40,200
I know. You may leave.

288
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,560
My Lord.

289
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,640
Newlyweds parted so soon.
Can't they have a few tender words?

290
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,760
You've delivered your message.
Give them some privacy.

291
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:54,200
I'll return first and inform His Grace.

292
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,800
How tactless.

293
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:28,480
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

294
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:32,880
My Lady.

295
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,800
Lady Shou'an sent over some Baoyuan Pills.

296
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,040
She says your cousin

297
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:38,280
paid a fortune from a renowned
physician in Jiangnan.

298
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:41,080
They're supposed to protect you
from the plague.

299
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,640
Lady Shou'an was very insistent.

300
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,880
She wants you to take one right away,
just to be safe.

301
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,920
My cousin
couldn't have predicted this outbreak.

302
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:55,800
This life-saving medicine
was clearly meant for my grandmother.

303
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:58,920
I can't accept it. Send it back.

304
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:01,560
- But, My Lady…
- I'm perfectly healthy. I don't need it.

305
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,560
Go on.

306
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,080
Yes, My Lady.

307
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:08,520
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

308
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,160
My Lady!

309
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:17,200
Don't make a fuss.
It's just a slight chill.

310
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,960
- I'll be fine.
- But you…

311
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:21,720
More people are falling ill in the city.

312
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,960
Send word to the Duke's Residence.

313
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:27,600
Tell them to shut the gates now.
No outsiders are to be admitted.

314
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:30,480
Mother and Fourth Aunt
must stop visiting, too.

315
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:31,400
We can't risk bringing the plague in.

316
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,240
My Lady…

317
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,040
I'll take a hot bath to warm up.
Prepare it.

318
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:56,720
<i>Aman. I need you to visit someone for me.</i>

319
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,920
Who might you be, miss?

320
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:08,520
Noble Lady Wu'an
just passed Zhang Sheng's Bakery.

321
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,720
She remembered
how much you love their date cakes.

322
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:12,520
She asked me to bring you some.

323
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:17,800
No wonder the magpies
were chirping this morning!

324
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:20,440
A distinguished guest has come to visit!

325
00:20:21,600 --> 00:20:24,880
How kind of Her Ladyship
to remember an old woman like me.

326
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:26,880
Please, come inside.

327
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,920
Something suspicious about this old woman.

328
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,520
I'll keep watching here. Go report it.

329
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:34,640
Yes.

330
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:43,000
Miss. Here.

331
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,880
Thank you for coming all this way.

332
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,600
Remember what Her Ladyship said.

333
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,840
- Governess Liu, take care of yourself.
- I will.

334
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,440
The city's in chaos.
Keep your doors locked.

335
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:55,640
I'm just an old woman now.

336
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:59,480
Thanks to Her Ladyship,
I can live in peace.

337
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:01,000
I know what to do.

338
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,840
Tell Her Ladyship not to worry.

339
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:07,520
Thank you.
Take care on your way back, miss.

340
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,840
Get something to eat.

341
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:35,040
My Lady, Liu is here.

342
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:38,240
My Lady, Feng Sheng has fallen ill, too.

343
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:39,760
Got it.

344
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,600
How dare you!

345
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:49,040
When Lord Lu was in the capital,
at least someone was looking out for you.

346
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:50,280
But since he left,

347
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,520
you've been working here day and night.

348
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:54,080
No one can talk you out of it.

349
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:56,520
My Lady, surely you know the saying.

350
00:21:56,600 --> 00:21:58,080
A wise person doesn't court danger.

351
00:21:58,800 --> 00:22:00,400
Don't fool me
because I had little schooling.

352
00:22:01,360 --> 00:22:04,240
Aren't you Confucian scholars
all about accepting the will of Heaven?

353
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:06,360
If someone dies
doing what they believe is right,

354
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:09,920
isn't that an honorable death?

355
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,920
With you at Zhuyu Estate,
everyone stands united.

356
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:14,280
Nothing can shake us.

357
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,240
But if anything happens to you,

358
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,880
everything we've built will fall apart!

359
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,760
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

360
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,040
I'm fine.

361
00:22:29,360 --> 00:22:31,120
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

362
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,800
- My Lady! Fetch the physicians!
- My Lady!

363
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:34,000
Get the physicians!

364
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,720
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

365
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:52,160
Have you two physicians
reached a diagnosis?

366
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:54,080
Her Ladyship's pulse
is rapid and superficial.

367
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:55,040
The illness came on suddenly.

368
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:58,360
She has a persistent fever,
body aches, and a headache.

369
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:00,160
And she's suddenly feeling chills.

370
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,760
I'm afraid…

371
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:03,600
It's definitely the spring plague.

372
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,520
My Lady.

373
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:07,880
Thank you both.

374
00:23:14,840 --> 00:23:15,760
My Lady.

375
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:19,000
- Liu Ziyang.
- My Lady.

376
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:23,080
Starting today,
you're in charge of the estate.

377
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:24,960
Yes, My Lady.

378
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:27,960
- Xiao.
- My Lady.

379
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:31,600
All the estate guards
will be under your command.

380
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:34,280
Make sure you keep order in the estate.

381
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:36,040
Don't let any trouble start.

382
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:40,080
- Rest assured, My Lady.
- You may all leave.

383
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,480
While I'm ill,

384
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,920
don't let my grandmother or the Weis…

385
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:58,280
I understand, My Lady.
I won't tell anyone.

386
00:23:59,080 --> 00:24:01,440
You've taken your medicine, My Lady.
Please rest.

387
00:24:04,360 --> 00:24:05,680
I'm just exhausted.

388
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:08,400
I'll be fine after some rest.

389
00:24:09,560 --> 00:24:10,400
Don't worry too much.

390
00:24:16,080 --> 00:24:18,120
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

391
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,120
Aman.

392
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:32,600
Aman. About Her Ladyship's illness…

393
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:34,120
Should we inform Lord Lu?

394
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,440
Her Ladyship doesn't want
word getting out.

395
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,400
Send someone to the palace discreetly.

396
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,320
Aman.

397
00:24:50,840 --> 00:24:54,360
I've already spread word
that Her Ladyship fainted from exhaustion.

398
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:55,920
But the people…

399
00:24:57,280 --> 00:24:58,920
They follow her and trust no one else.

400
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,440
If she doesn't appear soon,

401
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:03,520
panic will spread.

402
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,520
Her Ladyship's health comes first.

403
00:25:07,120 --> 00:25:10,000
As for everything else,
we can't worry about that now.

404
00:25:20,280 --> 00:25:21,680
I heard Lord Han

405
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:23,560
once asked you
to identify Wei Rao in person.

406
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:25,920
Yet you deliberately
gave him vague answers.

407
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,560
You've been playing both sides.

408
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:31,680
Back then, I really didn't recognize her.

409
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:35,080
I wasn't trying to deceive anyone! I…

410
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:41,800
I wouldn't dare! Never again!

411
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:44,120
You'd be wise to cooperate.

412
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:46,080
Just say exactly what I tell you,

413
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:50,000
and these gold bars are yours.

414
00:25:51,800 --> 00:25:53,200
Otherwise,

415
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:55,360
you'll get to experience

416
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,760
all eighteen instruments of torture!

417
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:14,680
Whatever Your Ladyship says,

418
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:18,400
I'll do exactly as I'm told.

419
00:26:20,080 --> 00:26:20,960
Your Highness.

420
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:23,800
That old woman has confessed everything.

421
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:29,120
- Really?
- Everyone has their price.

422
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:32,920
What would a petty beggar
know about loyalty or honor?

423
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:35,720
We threatened her with a beating
and offered her a fortune.

424
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,840
Naturally, she spilt it all.

425
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,160
Nothing will go wrong this time.

426
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:43,720
People of such low birth…

427
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:46,440
they of course have no backbone.

428
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:49,640
Whatever I tell her to say,
she'll repeat it word for word.

429
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:53,080
Even if she's plotting something
and hasn't truly joined our side,

430
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:56,680
once the Empress Dowager
pronounces guilt before all,

431
00:26:56,760 --> 00:26:59,360
there'll be no turning back.

432
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,080
Good.

433
00:27:02,480 --> 00:27:05,040
I'll go see Grandmother
at the palace right away.

434
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:16,160
What did you say?

435
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:18,360
I've secured a witness

436
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:19,960
who can prove Wei Rao is nothing but

437
00:27:20,040 --> 00:27:21,640
an impostor and a commoner's daughter.

438
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:27,120
His Majesty granted her
the title of Noble Lady.

439
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:29,560
If you're accusing her for that,

440
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:31,520
you'd better have solid proof.

441
00:27:33,360 --> 00:27:34,640
Your Majesty,

442
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:38,360
It's exactly because His Majesty
bestowed this title himself.

443
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,360
Lady Shou'an and her daughter

444
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:43,480
knew she was an impostor
and went to great lengths to cover it up.

445
00:27:44,320 --> 00:27:45,920
They've clearly deceived the Emperor.

446
00:27:46,520 --> 00:27:47,760
Such a crime is unforgivable.

447
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:52,040
In that case…

448
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:59,080
We ought to deal
with that old woman as well.

449
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,320
Anyone who deceives the Emperor

450
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:04,120
deserves to die.

451
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,640
By executing her,

452
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:08,840
Your Majesty is rooting out treachery

453
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:09,760
for the state.

454
00:28:11,080 --> 00:28:13,840
By the time His Majesty returns,
it'll be too late.

455
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:17,920
He's your own son.
What could he possibly do?

456
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:19,560
Grandmother,

457
00:28:20,080 --> 00:28:21,440
the dead cannot be brought back.

458
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:22,880
We mustn't let a dead woman

459
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:24,600
undermine your authority.

460
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,960
To protect the royal family's reputation,

461
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:29,160
Father will have no choice
but to see her as a traitor.

462
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:31,680
We may never get another chance.

463
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:33,760
Please make your decision, Grandmother.

464
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:40,480
Make the arrangements.

465
00:28:44,320 --> 00:28:46,400
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

466
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:01,840
- Continue your patrol.
- Yes, sir.

467
00:29:14,120 --> 00:29:14,960
What are you looking at?

468
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:17,840
Since I left, I wonder

469
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:20,400
is Wei Rao eating

470
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:21,840
and sleeping well?

471
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:29,640
You really think highly of yourself.

472
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,400
Do you think without you,

473
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:33,520
Noble Lady Wu'an
has no one to look after her?

474
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:37,640
She's as stubborn as a mule,

475
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:39,760
with a will of her own.

476
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:44,200
She'd never listen to anyone else.

477
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,200
What are you doing?

478
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:56,520
That's what you get for making me jealous.
It's enough to make my teeth ache.

479
00:29:57,560 --> 00:29:58,760
Since you can't sleep anyway,

480
00:29:58,840 --> 00:30:00,960
why don't you spar with me?

481
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,600
So be it.

482
00:30:05,120 --> 00:30:07,280
Let's find somewhere
I can put you through your paces.

483
00:30:08,120 --> 00:30:08,960
Follow me.

484
00:30:17,760 --> 00:30:18,720
My Lady.

485
00:30:25,600 --> 00:30:26,440
Who's on watch tonight?

486
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:29,920
Xiao doesn't trust anyone else to do it.
He insists on guarding you himself.

487
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:33,080
- Let him in.
- Yes, My Lady.

488
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:48,280
Xiao.

489
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:50,040
I sent Hongxian

490
00:30:50,560 --> 00:30:52,280
to the Fourth Prince's Residence.

491
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:54,360
Do you hate me for it?

492
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:56,280
If she'd ended up with me,

493
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:58,320
she would regretted it forever.

494
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:01,680
It's this unjust world
that's to blame. Not her.

495
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:03,920
Certainly not you.

496
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:08,720
You've been serving me all this time.
It's been unfair to you.

497
00:31:09,840 --> 00:31:11,160
I've spoken with Lord Lu.

498
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,880
You should be in the army
for better merit.

499
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:16,240
One day, you'll accomplish great things.

500
00:31:16,840 --> 00:31:19,080
When I see those corrupt,
incompetent officials,

501
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:21,600
I want to tear them apart.

502
00:31:22,320 --> 00:31:23,720
Even in the army,

503
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:25,080
only noble sons
can rise through the ranks.

504
00:31:26,320 --> 00:31:27,280
I'm not going anywhere.

505
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,640
I'll stay by your side
for the rest of my life.

506
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:37,840
All right.

507
00:31:42,120 --> 00:31:43,400
From this day forward,

508
00:31:44,560 --> 00:31:47,040
you'll be the sharpest blade in my hand.

509
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:49,200
Right now,

510
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,440
there's something I need you to do.

511
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:53,720
I'm at your command, My Lady.

512
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:01,080
ZHUYU ESTATE

513
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:10,640
Who dares trespass on Zhuyu Estate?

514
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,760
By order of the Empress Dowager,

515
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:14,800
we're here to arrest Wei Rao
for deceiving the Emperor.

516
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:17,240
Anyone who interferes
will face the same charges!

517
00:32:26,080 --> 00:32:27,520
My Lady, something terrible!

518
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:28,960
The Imperial Guards
have forced their way into the estate!

519
00:32:29,040 --> 00:32:31,040
They… they're…

520
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:35,080
What do you think you're doing?

521
00:32:37,480 --> 00:32:38,520
My Lady!

522
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:42,160
You vicious woman.

523
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:44,200
I've finally got you.

524
00:32:48,120 --> 00:32:49,960
What? Nothing to say?

525
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:54,320
This is but private vengeance.

526
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:56,240
You're the first to die.

527
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:59,720
I'll send Lu Zhuo
to join you in the underworld soon.

528
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:01,640
Move.

529
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:06,680
My Lady!

530
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:08,880
Move!

531
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,520
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

532
00:33:11,600 --> 00:33:12,440
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

533
00:33:15,280 --> 00:33:16,880
- After her! Hurry!
- This way!

534
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,320
- Stop!
- Keep up!

535
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,840
Stop!

536
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,200
Cut her off!

537
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,240
Why aren't we there yet?

538
00:33:34,320 --> 00:33:36,760
Don't worry, Grandmother.
We're almost there.

539
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:39,160
But there are patients at the estate.

540
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:40,320
You promised me

541
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,600
you'd only see Wei Rao
from outside the gates.

542
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:44,480
Once you know she's safe, we'll head back.

543
00:33:45,120 --> 00:33:46,000
Please keep your word.

544
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:48,320
I know.

545
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:50,080
I'm not as selfless as she is,

546
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:51,800
risking my life to save others.

547
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:54,800
I just want to see
Wei Rao get the medicine.

548
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:56,160
Then I'll leave right away.

549
00:34:08,159 --> 00:34:10,120
Lady Shou'an!
Something awful has happened!

550
00:34:15,120 --> 00:34:17,800
- Why have they arrested her?
- Exactly!

551
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:19,920
Why have they tied her up?

552
00:34:29,199 --> 00:34:31,760
Sound the gong! Gather the townspeople!

553
00:34:32,560 --> 00:34:34,960
Let them see for themselves how this fraud

554
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:37,800
deceived everyone
and passed herself off as a noblewoman!

555
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,360
- That can't be true!
- How is that possible?

556
00:34:41,040 --> 00:34:43,239
- How can they do such a thing?
- They've arrested Her Ladyship!

557
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:45,120
Why would they arrest her?

558
00:34:45,199 --> 00:34:46,400
What did she do wrong?

559
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:48,639
- She's a good person!
- Why are they doing this to her?

560
00:34:48,719 --> 00:34:50,280
- You can't do this!
- Exactly!

561
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:51,560
- Let her go!
- Why arrest her?

562
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:52,960
That's right! What has she done?

563
00:34:53,040 --> 00:34:55,320
- She's helped so many people!
- Let her go!

564
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,719
You'll pay for this soon enough.

565
00:35:00,520 --> 00:35:02,040
What's wrong with that man?

566
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:04,600
- Why did he shove her down?
- How can he do it?

567
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:07,200
The Empress Dowager has arrived!

568
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:11,440
Look! Look at those carriages!

569
00:35:13,680 --> 00:35:15,040
What's with this huge procession?

570
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:17,320
- That's our land!
- Those are our crops!

571
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:20,480
They're crushing all our food!

572
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:21,760
Exactly!

573
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:24,360
How could they do this?

574
00:35:24,440 --> 00:35:26,600
We worked so hard to grow those crops!

575
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:29,080
Why are they destroying our food?

576
00:35:29,160 --> 00:35:30,840
How could you do this to us?

577
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,240
This is outrageous!

578
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:33,520
They've trampled everything!

579
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:36,680
- The Empress Dowager's here!
- They're destroying our crops!

580
00:35:38,240 --> 00:35:39,600
How could they do this?

581
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:41,280
Greetings, Your Majesty.

582
00:35:50,120 --> 00:35:50,960
Kneel!

583
00:35:57,720 --> 00:35:58,640
Your Majesty.

584
00:35:58,720 --> 00:36:00,640
These mountain refugees
don't know proper manners.

585
00:36:00,720 --> 00:36:01,720
Please don't mind them.

586
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:03,840
- That's right!
- Make them kneel!

587
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,600
They trampled our crops!

588
00:36:05,680 --> 00:36:06,920
All of you, kneel!

589
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:08,160
- You crushed our crops!
- We won't kneel!

590
00:36:08,240 --> 00:36:09,920
- Kneel!
- Get down!

591
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:10,840
We won't!

592
00:36:10,920 --> 00:36:12,600
- Kneel!
- We refuse!

593
00:36:12,680 --> 00:36:14,240
- We won't!
- You destroyed our crops!

594
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:17,280
These ignorant peasants
are out of control.

595
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:20,280
Clearly, Wu'an has failed to teach them.

596
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:23,160
If this continues, rebellion will follow.

597
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:24,920
Bring in the witness.

598
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:32,240
Tell us everything you know.

599
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:35,200
Leave nothing out,
and your crimes will be forgiven.

600
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:38,600
I was close to Governess Chang,

601
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:42,440
a trusted servant of the First Madam
at the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

602
00:36:43,080 --> 00:36:45,200
One day, after she'd been drinking,

603
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:48,440
she told me how the Fourth Lady Wei
had gone missing as a child.

604
00:36:48,520 --> 00:36:51,360
Later, I happened to see her true face.

605
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:53,440
She looked just like my neighbor, A-Chou.

606
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:56,200
So I plotted with A-Chou's mother,
Madam Qiao,

607
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:59,200
to pass her off as Lady Wei for money.

608
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:09,080
<i>Lord Lu! Word from Zhuyu Estate!</i>
<i>Her Ladyship is gravely ill!</i>

609
00:37:09,720 --> 00:37:11,400
What proof do you have?

610
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:14,360
I have proof! Look!

611
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:17,120
See all these old scars on her arm?

612
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:21,240
This one came from a hot pot
when she was five.

613
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:25,840
And this one was from when her master
beat her with red-hot tongs.

614
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:28,120
Deny it all you want.

615
00:37:28,200 --> 00:37:30,520
Burned skin always leaves a scar.

616
00:37:30,600 --> 00:37:33,600
You used to collect night soil!

617
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:35,280
She's nothing but a fraud!

618
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:37,080
- You're lying!
- That's a lie!

619
00:37:37,160 --> 00:37:38,720
How could Her Ladyship be a fraud?

620
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,200
You're lying!

621
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:42,880
- Exactly!
- She's framing her!

622
00:37:42,960 --> 00:37:44,760
- Nonsense!
- That's right! All lies!

623
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:45,840
- She's making it up!
- Liar!

624
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:46,800
Get out of the way!

625
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:49,280
Help her up.

626
00:37:50,160 --> 00:37:51,280
Put this around her.

627
00:37:56,120 --> 00:37:57,200
Grandmother.

628
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,400
Your Majesty.

629
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:07,160
My poor Rao once lived
among the common folk.

630
00:38:07,240 --> 00:38:10,880
But as for which Wei Rao is real,
that matter was settled long ago.

631
00:38:11,560 --> 00:38:13,120
She is indeed Wei Rao,

632
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:15,440
Lady Li's own daughter.

633
00:38:15,520 --> 00:38:17,800
If Your Majesty still has doubts,

634
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:20,000
why not ask her birth mother

635
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:22,600
instead of some old woman
we know nothing about?

636
00:38:23,640 --> 00:38:24,800
Lady Shou'an,

637
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:27,400
Lady Li may be Wei Rao's birth mother,

638
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:31,160
but palace rules
kept them apart for years.

639
00:38:31,240 --> 00:38:32,280
How could she tell?

640
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:34,840
Poor Rao lost her parents

641
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:37,320
My parents raised her as their own.

642
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:39,920
We grew up together from infancy.

643
00:38:41,120 --> 00:38:42,320
I can vouch for her.

644
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:44,840
So can everyone at the Earl's Residence.

645
00:38:45,520 --> 00:38:49,400
Old Madam Wei is gravely ill,
and doesn't have long to live.

646
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:52,000
That's why you dare spout such nonsense.

647
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,240
You keep claiming you know her.

648
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,400
How could someone your age know?

649
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:58,120
Do you think your word carries more weight

650
00:38:58,200 --> 00:39:00,680
than Wei Rao's own mother and grandmother?

651
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:05,240
And don't forget
how you became Crown Princess.

652
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:07,280
Your second uncle

653
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:11,000
gave his life fighting
on the battlefield to earn you that title.

654
00:39:11,600 --> 00:39:12,960
Yet here you stand,

655
00:39:13,040 --> 00:39:15,840
slandering his only child!

656
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:19,920
Have you no conscience? Have you no shame?

657
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:21,560
How dare you!

658
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:24,120
The royal family respects you

659
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:26,320
because you once nursed my father.

660
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:28,040
How dare you speak so wildly,

661
00:39:28,120 --> 00:39:28,960
playing the elder like that!

662
00:39:29,560 --> 00:39:31,600
The Earl of Cheng'an
told Her Majesty everything.

663
00:39:31,680 --> 00:39:36,280
That woman is a fraud
who swindled people out of money!

664
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:40,520
Guards! Take the criminal A-Chou
to the imperial prison.

665
00:39:41,120 --> 00:39:43,080
Kill anyone who resists!

666
00:39:43,720 --> 00:39:45,240
- Let her go!
- Release Her Ladyship!

667
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:47,600
- Let her go!
- Stand back! Hear me?

668
00:39:47,680 --> 00:39:48,840
Stand back!

669
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:50,040
- Let her go!
- Release Her Ladyship!

670
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:52,280
Your Majesty, Wei Rao…

671
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:56,000
was personally granted
the title of Noble Lady Wu'an!

672
00:39:56,680 --> 00:39:58,720
Any charges must be heard by the court.

673
00:39:58,800 --> 00:40:02,440
His Majesty is away avoiding the plague,
and no one is presiding over the court.

674
00:40:02,520 --> 00:40:05,400
How can you simply imprison
someone who holds a noble title?

675
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,560
Grandmother.

676
00:40:09,560 --> 00:40:11,000
Don't you understand yet?

677
00:40:11,640 --> 00:40:12,920
The witness doesn't matter.

678
00:40:14,640 --> 00:40:16,320
Neither does her testimony.

679
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:20,160
The Empress Dowager

680
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:23,000
is taking advantage
of the Emperor and Lady Li's absence

681
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,000
to get rid of me.

682
00:40:25,080 --> 00:40:27,520
She wants to wipe me out

683
00:40:28,240 --> 00:40:29,560
so I'll never pose a threat again.

684
00:40:30,480 --> 00:40:33,160
Once I leave Zhuyu Estate today,

685
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:36,040
I'll likely die in some nameless valley.

686
00:40:36,640 --> 00:40:38,120
By the time His Majesty returns,

687
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:42,200
it'll be too late.
There'll be no one left to tell the truth!

688
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:45,160
Silence! A criminal
has no right to speak here!

689
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,560
Why did you hit him?

690
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:50,520
- What are you doing?
- Stop it!

691
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:53,480
If Lu Zhuo were here, he could fight me.

692
00:40:53,560 --> 00:40:55,240
But you think you can take me on?

693
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:58,360
Han Liao!
My cousin has nothing to do with this.

694
00:40:59,040 --> 00:41:00,200
Don't hurt an innocent man!

695
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:02,280
Still defending that pretty boy?

696
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,880
I'll cut off his head

697
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,880
and hang it
over the gates of Zhuyu Estate!

698
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:14,160
Your Majesty!

699
00:41:16,960 --> 00:41:18,160
Grandmother, don't beg her!

700
00:41:19,080 --> 00:41:20,920
- Grandmother!
- Your Majesty!

701
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:24,400
I was foolish and stubborn before.
I offended you time and again.

702
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:27,200
I alone am to blame for everything.

703
00:41:27,720 --> 00:41:31,120
Beat me or punish me however you wish.

704
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:32,320
Get up.

705
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:36,080
Please, get up! Get up!

706
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:42,920
My dear Rao

707
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,720
has suffered so much in her life.

708
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:49,120
She knows how hard
life is for ordinary people.

709
00:41:49,640 --> 00:41:52,240
That's why she worked so hard
to build this estate,

710
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:55,080
to shelter the poor and helpless.

711
00:41:55,160 --> 00:41:56,920
What has she done wrong?

712
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:58,960
You wanted to see her hands, didn't you?

713
00:41:59,040 --> 00:42:01,200
Then take a closer look!

714
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:03,800
Rao works alongside the common folk.

715
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:06,160
Her hands are covered
in scars and calluses.

716
00:42:07,680 --> 00:42:09,640
Even the clothes she wears

717
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:12,520
are never made of soft silk.

718
00:42:13,400 --> 00:42:15,840
She wears cotton woven here at the estate.

719
00:42:16,720 --> 00:42:19,320
All the gold, silver,
and jewels His Majesty gave her

720
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:22,120
were traded for coarse grain
to feed the hungry.

721
00:42:22,200 --> 00:42:23,640
The granaries

722
00:42:24,600 --> 00:42:25,960
are completely empty now.

723
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:29,400
She's given everything to save lives.

724
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,800
So here,

725
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:33,480
I beg Your Majesty to show mercy.

726
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:37,360
Take me away in chains instead.
Please, spare her.

727
00:42:37,880 --> 00:42:41,120
No. Don't, Grandmother.

728
00:42:41,880 --> 00:42:44,600
Lady Shou'an, you and your daughter

729
00:42:45,120 --> 00:42:46,680
are both blind to the truth.

730
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:49,320
You actually believe this impostor,

731
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:52,000
and killed the real Wei's daughter.

732
00:42:53,080 --> 00:42:54,720
And you still refuse
to admit your mistake.

733
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:58,400
Now, in your pursuit of power,

734
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:00,520
you've only made things worse.

735
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:01,880
You've sealed your own fate.

736
00:43:02,800 --> 00:43:05,160
You brought this woman,
who falsely claimed noble birth,

737
00:43:05,240 --> 00:43:06,880
into the palace

738
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:09,240
and deceived the Emperor.

739
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:13,200
Defending her
only proves you're guilty, too.

740
00:43:14,040 --> 00:43:18,880
Guards. Take them both to prison
and interrogate them under torture.

741
00:43:18,960 --> 00:43:20,480
Grandmother! Wei Rao!

742
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:23,720
Guards!

743
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:25,160
- Release Her Ladyship!
- Let her go!

744
00:43:25,240 --> 00:43:26,080
Let go of me!

745
00:43:26,160 --> 00:43:27,000
- Release Her Ladyship!
- Let her go!

746
00:43:27,080 --> 00:43:28,440
- Grandmother!
- Let go!

747
00:43:28,520 --> 00:43:29,440
- Grandmother!
- Let go of me!

748
00:43:29,520 --> 00:43:31,920
- Grandmother!
- I won't let go! Rao!

749
00:43:32,000 --> 00:43:33,560
I won't let go!

750
00:43:33,640 --> 00:43:35,360
- Han Liao!
- Rao!

751
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:37,280
His Majesty holds Lady Shou'an
in the highest regard!

752
00:43:37,360 --> 00:43:38,520
Rao!

753
00:43:38,600 --> 00:43:41,360
Aren't you afraid he'll make you pay?

754
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:45,200
If you must arrest someone,
arrest me instead.

755
00:43:47,840 --> 00:43:48,680
Your Majesty,

756
00:43:49,960 --> 00:43:52,080
this fraud has committed a terrible crime.

757
00:43:52,680 --> 00:43:54,960
Throwing her in prison
would be letting her off too easily.

758
00:43:55,040 --> 00:43:56,920
What do you suggest?

759
00:43:57,000 --> 00:44:01,120
Anyone caught deceiving the realm
should be paraded in a wooden collar

760
00:44:01,840 --> 00:44:03,160
to the sound of the gong.

761
00:44:03,240 --> 00:44:05,960
Let her serve as a warning to everyone.

762
00:44:08,120 --> 00:44:09,400
See to it.

763
00:44:13,520 --> 00:44:16,240
- Rao! Rao!
- Wei Rao!

764
00:44:16,320 --> 00:44:21,480
- Release Her Ladyship!
- Let her go!

765
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:25,160
Anyone who helps her will be punished!

766
00:44:25,240 --> 00:44:28,840
- Release Her Ladyship!
- Let her go!

767
00:44:29,440 --> 00:44:30,680
You brought this on yourself.

768
00:44:31,440 --> 00:44:34,600
Heavens above, open your eyes!

769
00:44:34,680 --> 00:44:37,920
Why do those who trample
the poor live in luxury,

770
00:44:38,000 --> 00:44:42,320
while those who work so hard go hungry?

771
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:46,760
He's taking away the one who saved us!

772
00:44:46,840 --> 00:44:50,320
You can't take Her Ladyship away!

773
00:44:51,040 --> 00:44:56,600
Set Her Ladyship free!

774
00:47:06,040 --> 00:47:08,600
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
